    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are delighted to present a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious four bedroom townhouse with the added benefit of a sunny west facing aspect and uninterrupted views overlooking Malahide Estuary. Perfectly positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Malahide’s Marina Village this fine townhouse has been maintained and upgraded to the highest of standards by its current owner and boasts an efficient ‘B’ rating on the BER. Upon arrival viewers will be instantly impressed by the bright and spacious living accommodation which comprises of reception hallway with porcelain floor tiles, stylish modern kitchen / dining area with extensive range of fitted press units, living room with feature fireplace and double doors opening to a west facing balcony with fabulous views. The second floor has two generous sized bedrooms with master en-suite & family bathroom. The top floor has two further bedrooms with one en-suite while the back bedroom has fantastic views across the Estuary. Further features include recently fitted PVC double glazed windows, modern Worcester gas boiler along with 3 parking permits. Located in the heart of Malahide Village with every conceivable amenity including award winning restaurants, cafes, boutiques, and bars all on your doorstep. Malahide boasts excellent transport links including easy access to the city centre via the Dart Station and multiple bus routes. Viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall\r\n4.27m (14'0\") x 1.91m (6'3\") Porcelain tiled floor. Ceiling coving. Recessed lighting. Radiator cover.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n6.17m (20'3\") x 4.29m (14'1\") Feature stone fireplace with Gazco gas fire. Ceiling coving. TV point. Double doors to west facing balcony.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\n4.3m (14'1\") x 3.06m (10'0\") Range of modern fitted press units. Tiled flooring. Integrated oven and hob. Fridge freezer, brand new washing machine. Quooker hot water top.\r\n\r\n1st Floor \r\nLanding\r\n3.78m (12'5\") x 2.16m (7'1\") \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.49m (11'5\") x 4.27m (14'0\") Built-in wardrobes. Views of Estuary.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.96m (6'5\") x 2.39m (7'10\") Comprising of bath with shower attachment and screen. W.C. & W.H.B. Recessed lighting. Heated towel rail. Tiled floor and part tiled walls.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.13m (10'3\") x 4.27m (14'0\") Built-in wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite\r\n1.22m (4'0\") x 2.01m (6'7\") Comprising of shower, W.C. & W.H.B. Tiled floor and part tiled walls.\r\n\r\n2nd Floor \r\nLanding\r\n4.14m (13'7\") x 2.01m (6'7\") (Measured at widest point)\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.64m (11'11\") x 3.72m (12'2\") Built-in wardrobes. Views of Estuary.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\n3.29m (10'10\") x 2.9m (9'6\") Built-in wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite\r\n2.99m (9'10\") x 2.05m (6'9\") Comprising of shower, W.C. & W.H.B. Tiled floor and part tiled walls.\r\n\r\nOutside: West facing balcony with uninterrupted views over the Malahide Estuary. Residential Parking Permit x 3."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious 4 Bedroom / 3 Bathroom Townhouse\r\nSunny West Facing Balcony\r\nStunning Views Over Malahide Estuary\r\nRecently Fitted PVC D/G Windows\r\nGas fired radiator central heating with Worcester boiler and Gazco Gas Fire In Living Room \r\n3 X Parking Permits\r\nLocated In The Heart Of Malahide Village\r\nManagement Fee €1,638 Per Annum"
